  "content": "<h2><strong>介紹</strong></h2><p><strong>💎你喜歡尋寶嗎？💎</strong></p><p><strong>🧭想讓你的探索更多樣化嗎？🧭</strong></p><p><strong>⚔️快把這個加到你的模組包裡吧！⚔️</strong></p><h2>特色功能&nbsp;</h2><ul>\n<li>探索並尋找 <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>超過 100 座建築</strong></span>，從小型遺跡到複雜地城應有盡有</li>\n<li>這些建築擁有 <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>多種變體</strong></span>，並由 <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>超過 850 個拼圖區塊</strong></span> 構成</li>\n<li>大部分建築內都有 <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>藏寶箱，內含獨特戰利品表與自訂物品</strong></span></li>\n<li>收集 <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>235 種自訂物品</strong></span>，包含 <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>飾品小玩意</strong></span> 與 <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>特殊武器</strong></span></li>\n<li>尋找並收集超過 <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>90 種自訂方塊</strong></span> 來裝飾你的基地</li>\n<li>尋找並擊敗超過 <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>30 種獨特動畫生物，其中包括一個 Boss</strong></span></li>\n<li>本模組 <strong>支援 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" rel=\"nofollow\">JEI</a></strong></li>\n<li><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>完全相容</strong></span> 眾多 <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>生態域模組</strong></span>（列表如下）</li>\n</ul><h2>需求</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/curios\" rel=\"nofollow\">Curios API</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" rel=\"nofollow\">GeckoLib</a></li>\n</ul><h2>設定</h2><ul>\n<li>如果你正在製作包含多個建築模組的模組包，並希望 Piglet Structures 的建築出現頻率大幅降低，請使用此版本：\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/piglet-structures-modpack-edition\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/piglet-structures-modpack-edition</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul><h2>維基</h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpiglet-structures.fandom.com%252fwiki%252fPiglet_Structures_Wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://piglet-structures.fandom.com/wiki/Piglet_Structures_Wiki</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>相容性</h2><p>此模組的建築透過精確的生態域標籤，與以下生態域模組完全相容：</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/regions-unexplored\" rel=\"nofollow\">Regions Unexplored</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oh-the-biomes-weve-gone\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Oh The Biomes We've Gone</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/biomes-o-plenty\" rel=\"nofollow\">Biomes O' Plenty</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/terralith\" rel=\"nofollow\">Terralith</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/incendium\" rel=\"nofollow\">Incendium</a></li>\n</ul><p>如需已標記生態域的完整列表，請點擊<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpiglet-structures.fandom.com%252fwiki%252fBiome_tags\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>。</p><h2>&nbsp;</h2><h2><strong>贊助</strong></h2><p><strong>如果你想支持我，幫助我創作更多模組，可以考慮請我喝杯咖啡……或是果昔、披薩；D ……或者我當下想吃什麼都行 xDD</strong></p><ul>\n<li><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252flordddiamond\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://ko-fi.com/lordddiamond</a></strong></li>\n</ul><h2>&nbsp;</h2><h2><strong>模組包</strong></h2><ul>\n<li>是的，你<strong>可以</strong>在你的模組包中使用它！😇</li>\n<li>有關模組元素（包括標籤）的所有詳細資訊，請查看<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpiglet-structures.fandom.com%252fwiki%252fPiglet_Structures_Wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\">維基</a>。</li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/Fxhsx3c/Neutral-Overworld-Ancient-Skeleton-Fortress-1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/nLwtbpQ/Neutral-Overworld-Ancient-Skeleton-Fortress-5.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/bd0bH1H/Plains-Mine-4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/KX83jPL/Birch-Forest-Gnome-Mansion-1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/9t3w0YP/Birch-Forest-Gnome-Mansion-7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/D8YqmBH/Nether-Wasteland-Ancient-Portal-1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/ByCrLgS/2024-01-22-20-14-57.png\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/0VdZwV0/2024-01-22-17-11-33.png\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/qmtfCn4/2024-05-01-18-18-37.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/9bcj9W5/Piglet-Structures-Mobs-1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/SVpH7sC/Soulsand-Valley-Bone-House-2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/bsGh22J/2024-01-22-17-21-34.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1481\" height=\"833\"></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwabbanode.com%252faffiliate%252fpiglet\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1404348/description_1eddde9a-fbdb-46c8-b853-20cd883a0110.png\" alt=\"\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
